---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";

const capabilities = [
  {
    title: "We manufacture",
    text: "Paints and coatings, engineered components, electronics and consumer goods made in our own facilities with batch-level control.",
    icon: "factory",
  },
  {
    title: "We apply",
    text: "Trained crews take on surface preparation, application and inspection so the specified system performs as written.",
    icon: "roller",
  },
  {
    title: "We deliver",
    text: "Dealer, project and e-commerce channels put the group's range within reach across the country.",
    icon: "ecommerce",
  },
] as const;
---

<section id="about" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white py-24 lg:py-32">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 -right-32 size-[26rem] rounded-full bg-mist blur-[80px]"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="container-page relative grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-20">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow text-signal-600" data-reveal>About Bi Group</p>
      <h2
        class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2rem,4.2vw,3.25rem)] leading-[1.05] font-extrabold text-navy-800"
        data-reveal
        style="--reveal-delay:60ms"
      >
        A group built the way a coating is specified — layer by layer.
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-7 max-w-xl space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-navy-900/70 lg:text-lg">
        <p data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:120ms">
          Bi Group began with paint and grew into ten connected businesses. Each one was added
          because customers asked us to solve the next problem: protect the steel, then coat the
          coil, then fit out the building, then keep it cool, then get the product to the door.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:180ms">
          The common thread is a manufacturing mindset — controlled formulation, documented
          specification and people who answer for the result long after handover. It is the reason
          steel majors, EPC contractors and the Ministry of Defence keep us on their approved lists,
          and the reason a family choosing an interior shade gets the same rigour.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="mt-10 grid max-w-xl gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:240ms">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-signal-500 pl-4">
          <dt class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-navy-800">Industrial rigour</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-navy-900/65">
            Inspection regimes set by our toughest customers become the group baseline.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-navy-200 pl-4">
          <dt class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-navy-800">Consumer clarity</dt>
          <dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-navy-900/65">
            Honest pricing, plain specifications and service that stays reachable.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>

      <a
        href="/about"
        class="link-sweep mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-sm font-bold text-navy-600"
        data-reveal
        style="--reveal-delay:300ms"
      >
        More about the group
        <Icon name="arrow-right" class="size-4" strokeWidth={2} />
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      {
        capabilities.map((item, index) => (
          <article
            class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-navy-100 bg-white p-6 shadow-card transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-navy-200 hover:shadow-lift"
            data-reveal="right"
            style={`--reveal-delay:${index * 100}ms`}
          >
            <span
              class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-1 origin-top scale-y-0 bg-signal-500 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-y-100"
            />
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span class="flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-navy-50 text-navy-600">
                <Icon name={item.icon as any} class="size-6" strokeWidth={1.7} />
              </span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-navy-800">{item.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-900/65">{item.text}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))
      }

      <blockquote
        class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-navy-800 p-7 text-white"
        data-reveal="right"
        style="--reveal-delay:320ms"
      >
        <div class="grain"></div>
        <p class="relative font-display text-lg leading-snug font-semibold">
          “Ten businesses only make sense if every one of them can be held to the same promise.”
        </p>
        <footer class="relative mt-4 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-signal-500 uppercase">
          The Bi Group commitment
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
